			"arabicnumber": 5274,
			"text": "Abu Hurairah reported the prophet (ﷺ) as saying:Allah most high says : “The son of Adam injures me by abusing time, whereas I am time. Authority is in my hand. I alternate the night and the day”. Ibn al-Sarh said: “on the authority of Ibn al-Musayyab instead of Sa’id’",
